    "comment": "Litzlitz (4545-lzl) = Critically Endangered (100 percent certain, based on the evidence available) (The language is rarely used. The only situations where Naman can be used are when the few remaining older speakers converse to each other. There are essentially no Naman speaking households. One speaker has insisted on speaking only Naman to his two sons, but they respond in Neve'ei.) [Crowley 2006](cldf:crowley:06:1)"
